From: Jon West <electrikjesus@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 15:47:53 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] SystemUI: Add a KitKat skin for the Dual Shade panels

With persist.retro.ui_style=kitkat the quick settings panel shows the
KitKat tablet layout: a large Holo-blue clock header and one row per tile
with a Holo ON/OFF switch, with settings, power and edit kept underneath.
Both panels use Holo colors, black or navy per persist.retro.ui_style_variant.
